@startuml get-departments
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/v1/user/student/departments
caption CRB-31 · 인증한 gist 이메일 도메인의 학교 학과 목록

actor Client
participant "SignupStepGuard\nUserTypeGuard" as Guard
participant "StudentController" as Controller
participant "StudentService" as Service
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepository
participant "DepartmentRepository" as DepartmentRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/v1/user/student/departments\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard
  SignupStepGuard → UserTypeGuard — flow/auth-guards.puml
  @SignupStep({ step: "profile", allowActive: true })
  pending: next_step = profile 일 때만 (이메일 인증 이후) / active: 항상 통과 (마이페이지 수정)
  @UserTypes("student")
  401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / User not found
  403 Signup step mismatch / User type not allowed
end ref
Guard -> Controller: getDepartments(user)
Controller -> Service: getDepartments(userPk)

Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPk(userPk)
StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student WHERE user_pk = ?
PostgreSQL --> StudentRepository: row
StudentRepository --> Service: student | null
alt 재학생 행 없음 (가드 통과 뒤 다른 기기에서 현업자로 유형 변경)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 User type not allowed
end
note right of Service
  student.email은 항상 있음
  (profile 단계 = verified_at 있음, active = 인증 완료)
end note

Service -> DepartmentRepository: findByEmailDomain(student.email 의 @ 뒤)
DepartmentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT d.pk, d.name FROM department d\nJOIN school s ON s.pk = d.school_pk\nWHERE s.email_domain = ? ORDER BY d.pk
PostgreSQL --> DepartmentRepository: rows
DepartmentRepository --> Service: { pk, name }[]
note right: 학교 도메인이 seed에서 빠졌으면 빈 배열

Service --> Controller: { departments: [{ id, name }] }
Controller --> Client: 200 { departments: [{ id, name }] }

@enduml
